[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-100
TITLE: System Data management
STATEMENT: >>>
In embedded database mode, calibration data, system settings, QC history, and warmup history are stored in the same encrypted local relational database as the patient and treatment records. The existing Protocol Buffers JSON repository representation is retained. SQLCipher provides whole-database encryption and cryptographic page-integrity protection for these system records as well as clinical data.

<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-126
  ROLE: Refines
