  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-789
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-333
TITLE: Automatically Identify connected collimator type and configuration
STATEMENT: >>>
The Identification of the connected Collimator will be done according to the following sequence diagram:

1. The C&C app queries the connected collimator (chip) for its ID (64-bit ID).

1. The C&C queries DB Service (Moses) for the collimator data for this ID. The return value includes a foreign key for the collimator\_configuration.

2. The C&C queries DB Service for the collimator's configuration, which returns the Type, Energy, and SSD of the connected collimator.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-332
  ROLE: Refines

