[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-622
TITLE: User Login Sequence
STATEMENT: >>>
1. The user is presented with username and password.
2. AuthService validates the credentials against the persisted account. Incorrect passwords for unlocked accounts increment the persisted failed-login count; accounts at or above 10 failures reject login even with a correct password. Restart does not clear the count.
3. The server persists the login outcome security record without passwords or tokens. An audit persistence error fails closed without issuing a session. Authentication failures are presented to the user.
4. A valid login below the threshold resets the failed-login count to zero. Only after the outcome is persisted does the application configure AuthorizedUser with the issued auth token and user information and close the login screen.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-74
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-648
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-623
TITLE: Disable Treatment when the Patient's Plan is Inconsistent
STATEMENT: >>>
Sequence Diagram:
Sequence Diagram:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       participant PrescriptionModel
       participant PlanViewModel
       participant CollimatorModel
       participant PlanModel

       PrescriptionModel->>PlanViewModel: Prescription changed
       activate PlanViewModel
       PlanViewModel->>PlanModel: fetch latest plan
       activate PlanModel
       
       Note over PlanModel: fetch plan data
       PlanModel-->>PlanViewModel: plan
       deactivate PlanModel
       
       PlanViewModel->>CollimatorModel: get active collimator
       CollimatorModel-->>PlanViewModel: 
       
       Note over PlanViewModel: check collimator

       alt collimator mismatch
           Note over PlanViewModel: disable treatment
           Note over PlanViewModel: show message
       end
       deactivate PlanViewModel
   </pre>
<<<
