- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-23
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-331
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-631
TITLE: view patient's prescription
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall provide the ability for authorized users to view the patient's prescription information. The prescription view shall display relevant treatment prescription details associated with the patient's treatment plan.

The operator shall be able to access and review the prescription details for a patient through the patient's treatment plan view.

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       
       box Application
           participant SimulationModel
           participant PrescriptionViewModel
           participant PrescriptionModel
           participant IEmrPrescriptionCommands
       end
       
       box Server
           participant PrescriptionService
       end

       Note over SimulationModel, IEmrPrescriptionCommands: User selects a site or changes its simulation
       
       SimulationModel-->>PrescriptionViewModel: simulation changed
       activate PrescriptionViewModel
       
       alt existing simulation
           PrescriptionViewModel->>PrescriptionModel: fetch prescription
           activate PrescriptionModel
           PrescriptionModel->>IEmrPrescriptionCommands: fetch simulation's prescriptions
           activate IEmrPrescriptionCommands
           
           IEmrPrescriptionCommands->>PrescriptionService: grpc:ListPrescriptionsRequest
           activate PrescriptionService
           Note over PrescriptionService: handle request
           PrescriptionService-->>IEmrPrescriptionCommands: grpc:ListPrescriptionsResponse
           deactivate PrescriptionService
           
           IEmrPrescriptionCommands-->>PrescriptionModel: list of prescriptions
           deactivate IEmrPrescriptionCommands
           
           Note over PrescriptionModel: select latest prescription
           PrescriptionModel-->>PrescriptionViewModel: [optional] prescription
           deactivate PrescriptionModel
           
           Note over PrescriptionViewModel: update prescription form
       end
       deactivate PrescriptionViewModel
   </pre>

Fulfilled requirements:
- RQ-H10SG-24-#12: Patients - Plan view - view patient's prescription
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-24
  ROLE: Refines

