[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-685
TITLE: Display Quality Checks Reports
STATEMENT: >>>
The quality check history shall include the following fields:
 - Timestamp
 - Performed by
 - Emission Current
 - Heater Current
 - Duration
 - Collimator configuration

The report will be retrieved from the database using the QcSampleService.

Each result row is keyed to a requested QA emission rather than a firmware point index. The
report presents its emission current, measured intensities, and deviations from the matching
reference result without creating rows for emissions that were not requested.
<<<
