- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-111
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-698
TITLE: Retrieve Treatment History Sequence
STATEMENT: >>>
Sequence diagram for retrieving treatment history when the selected plan changes:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(245, 245, 245) Application
        participant TreatmentsViewModel
        participant TreatmentHistoryModel
        participant IEmrTreatmentCommands
        participant IEmrActualTreatmentFieldCommands
    end

    box rgb(245, 245, 245) Server
        participant TreatmentService
        participant TreatmentFieldService
    end

    Note over TreatmentsViewModel: TreatmentInfoStore.PlanChanged
    alt [different plan selected]
        TreatmentsViewModel->>TreatmentHistoryModel: SetContext(diagnosis, prescription, plan)
        TreatmentsViewModel->>TreatmentHistoryModel: FetchTreatmentsAsync()
    else [same plan refreshed]
        TreatmentsViewModel->>TreatmentHistoryModel: UpdateTreatmentsAsync()
    end
    activate TreatmentHistoryModel
    TreatmentHistoryModel->>IEmrTreatmentCommands: ReadListAsync(plan.Id)
    IEmrTreatmentCommands->>TreatmentService: grpc:ListTreatmentsRequest
    TreatmentService-->>IEmrTreatmentCommands: grpc:ListTreatmentsResponse
    IEmrTreatmentCommands-->>TreatmentHistoryModel: treatments
    loop [for each treatment in ID order]
        TreatmentHistoryModel->>IEmrActualTreatmentFieldCommands: ReadListAsync(treatment.Id)
        IEmrActualTreatmentFieldCommands->>TreatmentFieldService: grpc:ListActualTreatmentFieldsRequest
        TreatmentFieldService-->>IEmrActualTreatmentFieldCommands: grpc:ListActualTreatmentFieldsResponse
        IEmrActualTreatmentFieldCommands-->>TreatmentHistoryModel: actual treatment fields
        TreatmentHistoryModel->>TreatmentHistoryModel: map field display names and add treatment
    end
    TreatmentHistoryModel->>TreatmentHistoryModel: update treatment history and summary
    TreatmentHistoryModel-->>TreatmentsViewModel: observable data changed
    deactivate TreatmentHistoryModel
   </pre>
<<<
