[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-701
TITLE: Retrieve Patient's Treatment Simulation
STATEMENT: >>>
Sequence diagram for retrieving the latest treatment simulation, its devices, and its
patient positions when the user selects a site or requests a refresh:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
    participant SimulationViewModel
    participant SimulationRepository
    participant IEmrSimulationCommands
    participant IEmrTreatmentDeviceCommands
    participant IEmrPatientPositionCommands
    participant TreatmentInfoStore

    Note over SimulationViewModel: DiagnosisChanged, ReloadCommand, or PlanStatusChangedEvent
    SimulationViewModel->>SimulationRepository: FetchLatestSimulationAsync(diagnosis.Id)
    activate SimulationRepository
    SimulationRepository->>IEmrSimulationCommands: ReadListAsync(diagnosis.Id)
    IEmrSimulationCommands-->>SimulationRepository: simulations
    SimulationRepository->>SimulationRepository: select simulation with greatest ID
    SimulationRepository-->>SimulationViewModel: optional latest simulation
    deactivate SimulationRepository

    opt [simulation exists]
        SimulationViewModel->>SimulationRepository: FetchTreatmentDevicesAsync(simulation.Id)
        SimulationRepository->>IEmrTreatmentDeviceCommands: ReadListAsync(simulation.Id)
        IEmrTreatmentDeviceCommands-->>SimulationRepository: treatment devices
        SimulationRepository-->>SimulationViewModel: treatment devices

        SimulationViewModel->>SimulationRepository: FetchPatientPositionsAsync(simulation.Id)
        SimulationRepository->>IEmrPatientPositionCommands: ReadListAsync(simulation.Id)
        IEmrPatientPositionCommands-->>SimulationRepository: patient positions
        SimulationRepository-->>SimulationViewModel: patient positions
    end

    SimulationViewModel->>TreatmentInfoStore: SetSimulation(simulation, devices, positions)
    TreatmentInfoStore-->>SimulationViewModel: simulation data changed
    SimulationViewModel->>SimulationViewModel: update simulation form
   </pre>
<<<
